t, was a Schwarzman Scholar at Tsinghua University, and earned a degree in Computer Science from Princeton…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.understandingai.org/p/ai-is-just-starting-to-change-the?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://www.understandingai.org/p/ai-is-just-starting-to-change-the?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/ai-links-1182026">AI links, 1/18/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.understandingai.org/p/ai-is-just-starting-to-change-the?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.understandingai.org/p/ai-is-just-starting-to-change-the?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Jan 2026 13:03:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[LLMs are lagging indicators]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>I’m an AI optimist but I also recognize that large language models (LLMs) are fundamentally more backward looking than predictive. Sure they can be engines of innovation but they’re best used as archives of consensus. The key concept is “temporal misalignment,” the phenomenon where performance degrades when they encounter facts, slang, or cultural shift…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://hollisrobbinsanecdotal.substack.com/p/llms-are-lagging-indicators?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://hollisrobbinsanecdotal.substack.com/p/llms-are-lagging-indicators?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/ai-links-1182026">AI links, 1/18/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://hollisrobbinsanecdotal.substack.com/p/llms-are-lagging-indicators?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hollisrobbinsanecdotal.substack.com/p/llms-are-lagging-indicators?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Jan 2026 13:03:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Among the Agents]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>Introduction…</p><p>URL: <a href="https://www.hyperdimensional.co/p/among-the-agents?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web">https://www.hyperdimensional.co/p/among-the-agents?utm_source=substack&utm_campaign=post_embed&utm_medium=web</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://arnoldkling.substack.com/p/ai-links-1182026">AI links, 1/18/2026</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.hyperdimensional.co/p/among-the-agents?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.hyperdimensional.co/p/among-the-agents?utm_source=substack&amp;utm_campaign=post_embed&amp;utm_medium=web</guid><pubDate>Sun, 18 Jan 2026 13:03:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>